2. Introduce optimizer-specific limits with no USD field:

```python
@dataclass(frozen=True)
class PitOptimizerLoopLimits:
    max_iterations: int
    max_api_calls: int
    max_tokens: int
    api_timeout_seconds: float
    child_timeout_seconds: float
    wall_timeout_seconds: float
