```

3. Make the parser's global `--max-usd` optional syntactically. Require it for every existing non-`pit_optimizer` route and reject it for `pit_optimizer`. Construct `PitOptimizerLoopLimits` only for the optimizer path and retain `LoopLimits` with enforced USD everywhere else.
4. Remove optimizer `max_usd` from config, live preauthorization, resource-ledger construction, prepare lines, emitted canary command, summaries, and stop conditions. Do not weaken legacy route cost controls.
5. Update `core/pit_optimization.py` bottom adapters only; the earlier legacy `PitOptimizationGateConfig` and legacy optimizer remain unchanged.
6. Update all changed production call sites to the final schema-v3 Task 1–3 interfaces. Preserve exact six calls/448000 tokens/two iterations, `provider_retries=0`, `apply=false`, sealed source/fold/policy identities, one-shot authorization, network-disabled disposable workers, output bounds, cleanup, and public redaction.

